  "bodyHash": "7d76b4b7e82559c7",
  "content": "\n\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fserilum.com%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/header/header.png\" alt=\"一个 Serilum 模组。用心打造。为 Fabric、Forge 和 Neo 提供大量活跃模组！\" width=\"838\" height=\"400\"></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/members/serilum/projects\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/curseforge.svg\" alt=\"CurseForge\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252fSerilum\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/modrinth.svg\" alt=\"Modrinth\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"https://patreon.com/serilum\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/patreon.svg\" alt=\"Patreon\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"https://youtube.com/@serilum\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/youtube.svg\" alt=\"YouTube\" width=\"200\"></a></p>\n<h2><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/about-the-mod.svg\" alt=\"关于模组\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">Difficulty Lock 提供了一种简单的方式来配置所有（新建）世界的难度。对于整合包作者很有用，或者如果你在玩单人游戏时总是希望使用某个默认难度，它也能派上用场。配置项支持强制开启极限模式、禁用作弊，或阻止玩家选择创造模式。<br><br>创建世界界面会根据配置正确更新。同时支持（专用）服务器运行。</span></p>\n<h2><br><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/dependencies.svg\" alt=\"依赖项\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/collective\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/dependencies/requires/collective.svg\" alt=\"需要 Collective\" width=\"251\" height=\"49\"></a><br><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/serilums-customization-bundle\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/dependencies/includes/customization-bundle.svg\" alt=\"包含于 Serilum 的自定义组件包中\" width=\"416\" height=\"49\"></a><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/environment/server.svg\" alt=\"环境：服务端\" width=\"220\" height=\"49\"></p>\n<h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/configurable.svg\" alt=\"可配置\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fserilum.com%252fconfiguration-guide\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/configuration-guide.svg\" alt=\"配置指南\" width=\"220\" height=\"49\"></a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size:18px\">所有可用的配置选项：</span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\" style=\"margin-left:10px;padding-left:10px\">\n<p><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><em>优先级表示当配置中多个难度选项被设为 true 时，模组如何处理。例如，如果全部启用，则所有新世界的难度都会变为和平。</em></span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>forceHardcoreMode</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;默认值：false</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">启用后，将世界游戏模式设置为极限模式，并忽略其他难度设置。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>disableCreativeModeSelection</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;默认值：false</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">是否禁止在创建世界界面中选择创造模式。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>forcePeaceful</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;默认值：false</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">优先级 1：启用后，将所有世界的难度设置为和平。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>forceEasy</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;默认值：false</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">优先级 2：启用后，将所有世界的难度设置为简单。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>forceNormal</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;默认值：false</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">优先级 3：启用后，将所有世界的难度设置为普通。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>forceHard</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;默认值：true</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">优先级 4：启用后，将所有世界的难度设置为困难。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>forceCheatsDisabled</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;默认值：false</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">是否在初始创建世界界面强制禁用“允许作弊”选项。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>shouldLockDifficulty</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;默认值：true</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">启用后，锁定任意世界的难度，使其无法更改。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>shouldChangeDifficultyWhenAlreadyLocked</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;默认值：false</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">启用后，也会对已经锁定难度的世界重新设置难度。</span></p>\n</div>\n<h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/showcase.svg\" alt=\"展示\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">使用默认配置时，所有世界都会被设置为困难难度，并且难度将被锁定：</span><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/difficulty-lock/a.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1142\" height=\"597\"></span></p>\n<p><br><br><span style=\"font-size:18px\">创建世界界面也会同步更新。<br>此处配置项 <strong><em>forceHard</em></strong> 和 <strong><em>forceCheatsDisabled</em></strong> 均为 <strong><em>true</em></strong>：</span><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/difficulty-lock/b.png\" alt=\"\"><br><br></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">通过配置，该模组还可以强制用户以极限模式游玩：</span><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/difficulty-lock/c.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/notes-n-links.svg\" alt=\"注意事项与链接\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>您可以自由在任何整合包中使用本模组，只要下载源仍托管在 CurseForge 或 Modrinth 生态系统中即可。</strong></span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a style=\"font-size:18px;color:#008000\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fserilum.com%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Serilum.com</a> 提供了所有可用模组的概览及更多信息。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\">由于我无法在如此多独立的模组页面中逐一追踪评论，评论功能已关闭。</span><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><br>如有问题、想法、建议或其他反馈，请访问我们的&nbsp;<a style=\"font-size:14px;color:#008000\" href=\"https://github.com/Serilum/.issue-tracker\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">GitHub 仓库</a>。谢谢！</span><span style=\"font-size:6px\"><br><br></span></p>",
